# Compiled theme assets — BUILD OUTPUTS of `web:build`, not source:
#   - theme/pivox/account/resources/app/   ← @pivox/account-console vite bundle
#     (index.html, index.js, assets/index.css, bundled fonts)
#   - theme/pivox/login/resources/css/theme.css ← build.mjs Tailwind compile
#
# They must NOT be tracked: they silently go stale whenever a bundled component's
# Tailwind class set changes without a rebuild (e.g. the autocomplete->combobox
# primitive rename left the committed account index.css a diff forever). Dev
# regenerates them via `web:build` and Keycloak serves them over the apphost
# bind-mount; a future prod theme-packaging step must likewise run `web:build`
# before packaging. Hand-authored files (.ftl templates, theme.properties,
# messages/, the login resources/fonts/*) stay tracked.
/theme/pivox/account/resources/app/
/theme/pivox/login/resources/css/theme.css
